{"id":1492598,"slug":"american-horror-story-2011","title":"American Horror Story","title_en":"American Horror Story","year":2011,"rating":81,"votes_count":20233,"runtime_min":null,"age_rating":null,"title_type":"seriál","vod_date":null,"plot":"SeriálAmerican Horror Storyje, jak už název napovídá, hororovým seriálem.American Horror Storyvšak není ledajaký seriál. Má tu zvláštnost, že každá série má stejné herce, ale úplně jiný příběh. Seriál nás zavede do strašidelného domu, psychiatrické léčebny, spolku čarodějnic v New Orleans, do panoptika, do tajemného hotelu a do Ameriky pod velením Donalda Trumpa. Těšte se. Budete se bát!(Bull)","poster":"https://image.pmgstatic.com/cache/resized/w140/files/images/film/posters/168/089/168089674_0cfmz7.png","backdrop":null,"trailer_youtube_id":null,"genres":["Drama","Horor","Sci-Fi","Thriller"],"tags":["podle knihy","smrt","vražda","strach","politika","drogy","krev","dům","svatba","sériový vrah","duchové","hotel","magie","posedlost","upíři","zlo","antologie","čarodějnice","psychiatrická léčebna","cirkus","kult","masový vrah","posedlost démonem","posedlost duchem"],"countries":["USA"],"directors":["Bradley Buecker","Ryan Murphy","Angela Bassett","Jeremy Podeswa","Michael Rymer","Alfonso Gomez-Rejon","Howard Deutch","Michael Uppendahl","Craig Zisk","Michael Lehmann","David Semel","Michael Goi","Loni Peristere","Anthony Hemingway","Jennifer Lynch","Marita Grabiak","Nelson Cragg","John Scott","Tim Hunter","Miguel Arteta","Elodie Keene","Gwyneth Horder-Payton","Alexis Ostrander","Kevin R. Hershberger","Liza Johnson","Maggie Kiley","Barbara Brown","Sarah Paulson","Sheree Folkson","Rachel Goldberg","Jennifer Arnold","Evan Peters","John J. Gray","Mary Wigmore","Liz Friedlander","Axelle Carolyn","Max Winkler","Tessa Blake","Laura Belsey","Paris Barclay","Yona Speidel","Jessica Yu"],"actors":["Sarah Paulson","Evan Peters","Lily Rabe","Jessica Lange","Denis O'Hare","Kathy Bates","Angela Bassett","Frances Conroy","Taissa Farmiga","Emma Robe